@CommentService_HostAddress = http://127.0.0.1:5049
@ArticleId = 1

GET {{CommentService_HostAddress}}/Comment/article/{{ArticleId}}
Accept: application/json

### Repeat to demonstrate a CommentCache hit

GET {{CommentService_HostAddress}}/Comment/article/{{ArticleId}}
Accept: application/json

###

POST {{CommentService_HostAddress}}/Comment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "articleId": {{ArticleId}},
  "authorName": "Cache demo",
  "content": "This comment invalidates the cached list."
}

### The POST makes this a miss and reloads the complete list

GET {{CommentService_HostAddress}}/Comment/article/{{ArticleId}}
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{CommentService_HostAddress}}/Comment/article/999999
Accept: application/json

### Repeat to demonstrate a cached empty-list hit

GET {{CommentService_HostAddress}}/Comment/article/999999
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{CommentService_HostAddress}}/metrics
